mermaid`
sequenceDiagram
    participant MES as MES (Manufacturing Execution System)
    participant ClockSync as Clock Sync Protocol (TSN/NTP)
    participant Robot as Robotic Arm
    participant Tool as Process Tool (Laser/Etch)
    participant Sensor as Inline Sensors
    participant Logger as Data Logger

    MES->>MES: ① Wafer ID scanned, recipe loaded
    MES->>ClockSync: ② Sync tool clocks (TSN/PTP)
    ClockSync->>Robot: Sync with robotic arm
    ClockSync->>Tool: Sync with process tool
    Robot->>Tool: ③ Transfer wafer
    Tool->>Tool: ④ Execute recipe steps
    Tool->>Sensor: ⑤ Report sensor data in real-time
    Tool->>Robot: ⑥ Transfer wafer out
    Tool->>Logger: ⑦ Log data to MES

    Note over ClockSync,Tool: Desync here causes cascading failure in all steps
